      "schema:name": "MEASLESDT02PlanDefinition",
      "dcterms:description": "Whether to vaccinate today, defer, or not vaccinate. Hit policy FIRST. A mild concurrent infection is not a reason to defer. Adjudication: pending. L3 of input/decision-logic/MEASLES.DT.02.dmn.",
